{"3787240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls", "steam_appid": 3787240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5030920, 4848500, 5030930], "detailed_description": "<h1>MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/daa28c9211a3efa79701f31e9293947e.avif?t=1787658133\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras_big/daa28c9211a3efa79701f31e9293947e.avif?t=1787658133 width=1560 height=1560 /></span><br>Edition includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls<br></li><li>Year 1 Characters and Stage Pass² (Includes four characters and one stage post-launch):<br>- Year 1 Character 1<br>- Year 1 Character 2<br>- Year 1 Character 3<br>- Year 1 Character 4<br>- Stage 1<br></li><li>Howard the Duck (Lobby Avatar) and Cosmo (Lobby Pet)</li></ul><br>²Set of result screen character poses is available instantly. The remainder of the content for the Year 1 Character and Stage Pass is expected to be made available by 31 December 2027.</p><br><h1>MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls Ultimate Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/25612e4e763c62d8b0cb568c7d2deabe.avif?t=1787658133\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras_big/25612e4e763c62d8b0cb568c7d2deabe.avif?t=1787658133 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edition includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 1 Characters and Stage Pass² (Includes four characters and one stage post-launch):<br>- Year 1 Character 1<br>- Year 1 Character 2<br>- Year 1 Character 3<br>- Year 1 Character 4<br>- Stage 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Howard the Duck (Lobby Avatar)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmo (Lobby Pet)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spider-Man “Advanced Suit 2.0” Costume</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storm Punk Rock Costume</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Man Classic Costume</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain America Classic Costume</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doctor Doom Supreme Ruler Costume</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated Chromatic color unlock² for all 20 launch characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >²Set of result screen character poses is available instantly. The remainder of the content for the Year 1 Character and Stage Pass is expected to be made available by 31 December 2027.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Edition includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls</li></ul><br>Assemble your team of legendary Marvel characters in the ultimate 4v4 tag team fighter from PlayStation Studios, Arc System Works and Marvel Games.<br><br>It’s time to build your dream team and break some spirits in blistering 4v4 fighting action. Choose from an expanding roster of 20 iconic Marvel characters at launch, each rendered in a bold new anime-inspired art style and members of their own unique teams of equally impressive heroes and villains.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.poster.avif?t=1787658133\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.webm?t=1787658133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.mp4?t=1787658133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experiment with team compositions to discover new combos, synergies, and strategies. Blast your way through dynamic stages based on iconic Marvel Universe locales, some featuring interactive stage transitions.<br><br>Fighting is both immersive and intuitive, with a range of unique move sets, combos, and strategies to master. Adjustable controls, both traditional and quick inputs, plus easy chain combos make diving right in a breeze.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/abfdd4740473c141f3c5eacbf3b7ea92.poster.avif?t=1787658133\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/abfdd4740473c141f3c5eacbf3b7ea92.webm?t=1787658133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/abfdd4740473c141f3c5eacbf3b7ea92.mp4?t=1787658133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face off against a friend locally or join the fray with up to 64 players in the online² lobby, including standard VS modes. Plus, dive deep on each team with the single player Episode Mode to learn more about team dynamics and lore.<br><br>²Internet connection and account for PlayStation required. <br><br>MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls features a wide range of offline content, including Episode Mode, local Versus, Training Mode, All-Star Arena, Character Guides and more.  <br><br>The mode Arcadia Rumble is also fully playable offline, with optional online features.  <br><br>A PlayStation Account and internet connection are required for Online Lobby, Room Matches (Private Rooms), Ranked Matches, Casual Matches, Player Profile and other online features.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PC feature</h2><strong>Ultra Settings</strong><br><br>Experience the action of MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls at high performance rates of 60fps (locked in battle) and super crisp 4K³ visuals.<br><br>³4K requires compatible 4K TV or display.<br><br><strong>DualSense® controller support</strong><br><br>Feel every super-powered blow and bombastic special move with the immersive haptic feedback of the DualSense® wireless controller.", "about_the_game": "Edition includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls</li></ul><br>Assemble your team of legendary Marvel characters in the ultimate 4v4 tag team fighter from PlayStation Studios, Arc System Works and Marvel Games.<br><br>It’s time to build your dream team and break some spirits in blistering 4v4 fighting action. Choose from an expanding roster of 20 iconic Marvel characters at launch, each rendered in a bold new anime-inspired art style and members of their own unique teams of equally impressive heroes and villains.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.poster.avif?t=1787658133\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.webm?t=1787658133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.mp4?t=1787658133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experiment with team compositions to discover new combos, synergies, and strategies. Blast your way through dynamic stages based on iconic Marvel Universe locales, some featuring interactive stage transitions.<br><br>Fighting is both immersive and intuitive, with a range of unique move sets, combos, and strategies to master. Adjustable controls, both traditional and quick inputs, plus easy chain combos make diving right in a breeze.<br><span class=\"bb_img